 ut a DOD ID needs a Real ID and a sponsored visitor's pass from the base 
 Visitor Control Center to get through the gate\, arranged on a weekday be
 fore 2 PM. Families wanting to decorate a car for the trunk-or-treat cont
 est can register a vehicle ahead of time for free.\nPrice: Free\nArea: De
 stin & Fort Walton\nTimes: Friday 10/30 · 4:00 PM to 7:00 PM\nChecked ag
